---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: How HEYwire works
description: Send the job in a few minutes, get a fixed price back the same day, schedule a window that works around your guests, and a crew is dispatched with the price already agreed.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h1 class="h1">Three steps. No runaround.</h1>
    <p class="lede">With most contractors, you wait for the beep, wait for a callback, wait for a site walk, wait again for a number, and then wait for their schedule. We built HEYwire so the number comes first.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <ol class="timeline">
      {% for step in site.steps %}
      <li class="timeline__item">
        <div class="timeline__marker">{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <div class="timeline__body">
          <h2 class="h3">{{ step.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ step.text }}</p>
          {% if loop.index == 1 %}
          <p class="muted">You answer four questions: property type, what needs wiring, how many, and where. Attach site plans if you have them. Standard jobs get a fixed price back the same day; complex projects take until the next day. Anything unusual gets flagged and we call you before we commit to a number.</p>
          {% elif loop.index == 2 %}
          <p class="muted">Days, nights, turnover days, or between check-out and check-in. You choose. The crew, the materials, and the work order are locked to that window.</p>
          {% else %}
          <p class="muted">The crew arrives knowing the scope, the route, and the price. When they leave you have test results, labels, and a clean site.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Questions we get</p>
    <div class="faq">
      {% for item in site.faq %}
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary class="faq__q">{{ item.q }}</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">{{ item.a }}</p>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
